      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements;\n- in enterprise -> no limit on no of users.\n- all things are channel\n- saving messages in db, no vanish.\n- high number of customers ?\n\n\nProblem in Whatsapp: \n- would redis pusub would be scale that much ? between persist solution.\n-  not sure reasoning, but basically replaced the redis pub-sub with channel servers\n   consistent hashing with channelId\n- and this is handled by orcestrator stateless.\n- channel server send message to gateway, servers -> which is connect to user via websocket\n- and also user send message itnially with http.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements;\n- in enterprise -> no limit on no of users.\n- all things are channel\n- saving messages in db, no vanish.\n- high number of customers ?\n\n\nProblem in Whatsapp: \n- would redis pusub would be scale that much ? between persist solution.\n-  not sure reasoning, but basically replaced the redis pub-sub with channel servers\n   consistent hashing with channelId\n- and this is handled by orcestrator stateless.\n- channel server send message to gateway, servers -> which is connect to user via websocket\n- and also user send message itnially with http.",
